<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>¡Compra Exitosa! | Jireth Store</title>
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root { 
            --primary: #10b981; 
            --dark: #0f172a;
            --bg-gray: #f8fafc;
        }

        body { 
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #ecfeff, #f8fafc);
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; 
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .success-container {
            background: white;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            animation: slideUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* Icono de Check Animado */
        .success-icon-wrapper {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: #f0fdf4;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .success-icon-wrapper::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
            100% { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0; }
        }

        .order-badge {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #64748b;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 100px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        h1 { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        p { color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; }

        .receipt-card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .receipt-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .btn-home {
            background: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            width: 100%;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
        }

        .btn-home:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-whatsapp {
            color: #16a34a;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="success-container">
        <!-- Brand Small Logo -->
        <div class="mb-4 small fw-800 text-primary opacity-50">JIRETH STORE</div>

        <div class="success-icon-wrapper">
            <i class="bi bi-check-lg"></i>
        </div>

        <div class="order-badge">
            <i class="bi bi-receipt me-1"></i> Transacción Aprobada
        </div>

        <h1>¡Pago Confirmado!</h1>
        <p>Gracias por preferir Minimarket Jireth. Hemos recibido tu pedido correctamente y ya estamos preparando todo para ti.</p>

        <!-- Detalle visual (Simulado o con datos reales si los pasas) -->
        <div class="receipt-card">
            <div class="receipt-item">
                <span class="text-muted">Método de pago</span>
                <span class="fw-bold">Webpay Plus</span>
            </div>
            <div class="receipt-item">
                <span class="text-muted">Estado</span>
                <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success">Completado</span>
            </div>
            <div class="receipt-item border-top mt-2 pt-2 fw-bold text-dark">
                <span>Fecha</span>
                <span><%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('es-CL') %></span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="btn-home">
            Volver a la Tienda <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2"></i>
        </a>

        <a href="https://wa.me/56948539049" target="_blank" class="btn-whatsapp">
            <i class="fab fa-whatsapp fs-5"></i> ¿Tienes dudas? Escríbenos
        </a>

        <p class="mt-4 small opacity-50">Se ha enviado un comprobante detallado a tu email.</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>